<H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Lands of Lor </H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<P>
<HR><BR>
<B><FONT COLOR="#FF0000"><FONT SIZE=+2>Area Info</FONT></FONT></B> <BR>
<BR>
<B>Dirs:</b>  This area is near the rest
of nym's areas on the far sw part of the map and is the combination of two
prior areas called The tower of the rainbow mages and Castle Tariel.
<BR>
<BR>
<b>Coder:</b> Nym (circa 1994), recoded 1998 by Entropy.<BR>
<BR>
<b>General Descrip:</b>
This converted area is part of a MEGA-quest of Nyms that will be added some day
which includes the areas of Akira, Rechendak, City of Lorenchia and a few
others.  
<BR>
<BR>
<b>Difficulty:</b> newbie (forest) to mid (castle and tower)<BR>
<BR>
<b>Area Size:</B> 62+<BR>
<BR>
<b>Last Update:  February, 2010</b> 
<br>
<BR>

